<title>USA: Noranda hikes U.S. aluminum price 5 cents.</title>
<headline>Noranda hikes U.S. aluminum price 5 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Inc said its December ingot and billet list prices in the U.S. were raised to 75 and 85 cents per pound respectively, both up five cents from November.</p>
<p>London Metal Exchange aluminum prices have risen in the past month.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
